What's going to define "society" in this sense is the reciprocity agreements
between security agencies.  That is, if I own Joe's Rent-a-Cop in Philadelphia,
it's to my advantage to have a contract with Julio's Security Services in LA
in case someone who done my client wrong does a bunk to La-La land.

