The Spawn work at Xerox PARC is probably what you heard of.  It
implements a variant of the escalator algorithm from the Agoric Papers
(the papers that basically started the field).  The experiment was
within trust boundaries.  Right now there's no reason to bother with
experiments across trust boundaries because the computational
infrastructure doesn't otherwise support such relationships (I can't
run encrypted source code on your machine without revelaing the source
